flowchart TB
    S[Work item] --> Q1{Needs hardware, specific arch, or measured performance?}
    Q1 -- yes --> BM[Bare metal via Testing Farm]
    Q1 -- no --> Q2{Needs a full OS: systemd, kernel modules, SELinux, RPM install?}
    Q2 -- yes --> VM[Virtual machine via Testing Farm]
    Q2 -- no --> Q3{Running inside the Konflux pipeline?}
    Q3 -- yes --> K8S[Kubernetes pod with gVisor or Kata]
    Q3 -- no --> POD[Podman on a runner or a developer machine]
